#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:8
msgid "资源模型"
msgstr "Resource Model"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:10
msgid "每个实例拥有一个有界 workspace。协议用私有固定池管理独立资源类别及容量。"
msgstr ""
"Every instance owns one bounded workspace. Private fixed pools manage the protocol's independently "
"bounded resource classes."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:12
msgid "分配阶段"
msgstr "Allocation Phases"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:14
msgid "`xgl_memory_requirements()` 校验配置，返回精确的 `size` 和 `alignment`。布局包括实例、池描述符、初始化对象和全部运行时槽位。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_memory_requirements()` validates the configuration and returns exact `size` and `alignment`. The "
"layout includes the instance, pool descriptors, initialization objects, and all runtime slots."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:16
msgid ""
"`xgl_init_static()` 使用调用方提供的对齐存储。`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` 的 `xgl_init_allocated()` "
"通过指定或编译选定的后端一次申请整个工作区。两条路径共用同一分区计划，成功时返回可立即使用的实例。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_init_static()` uses aligned storage supplied by the caller. `xgl_init_allocated()` in "
"`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` allocates the entire workspace once through the supplied or compiled backend. Both "
"paths use the same partition plan and return a ready instance on success."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:18
msgid ""
"准备完成后，初始化、发送、接收处理及清理都只使用 workspace。`xgl_destroy()` 将动态存储一次性归还原 backend；静态存储仍归调用者所有。借用的配置和上下文必须活到销毁结束。"
msgstr ""
"After preparation, init, sends, receive processing, and cleanup use only the workspace. `xgl_destroy()` "
"returns dynamic storage to the original backend once; static storage remains owned by the caller. "
"Borrowed configuration and contexts must outlive destruction."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:20
msgid ""
"`<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` 的 `xgl_memory_report()` 无分配地解释同一份规划，报告管理区、初始化区、peer、可靠记录及载荷、帧 scratch 和乱序 RX "
"占用。类别字节数包含对齐，合计恰好等于 `report.requirements.size`。失败不改写输出。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_memory_report()` in `<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>` describes the same plan without allocating. It "
"reports management and initialization storage, peer records, reliable records and payloads, frame "
"scratch, and out-of-order RX storage. All categories include alignment padding and sum to exactly "
"`report.requirements.size`. Failure leaves the output unchanged."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:29
msgid "独立资源池"
msgstr "Independent Resource Pools"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "资源"
msgstr "Resource"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "预留方式"
msgstr "Reservation"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "路由和链路"
msgstr "Routes and links"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "固定路由数组；每个独立 PHY 一个 parser cache"
msgstr "Fixed route arrays; one parser cache per distinct PHY"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "路由索引"
msgstr "Route index"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "embedded-lite/embedded/full 预分配 hash 桶和节点；boot 不包含"
msgstr "Preallocated hash buckets/nodes in embedded-lite/embedded/full; absent in boot"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "Peer 和窗口"
msgstr "Peer and window"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "每个 peer 容量一个 peer 对象及窗口存储"
msgstr "One peer object and window storage per peer capacity"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "可靠 TX"
msgstr "Reliable TX"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "按全局 TX 容量分别预留包记录和 payload 槽"
msgstr "Separate packet and payload slots per global TX capacity"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "帧 scratch"
msgstr "Frame scratch"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "同步且不可重入的 I/O 共用一个完整帧槽"
msgstr "One complete-frame scratch slot for synchronous, non-reentrant I/O"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "乱序 RX"
msgstr "Out-of-order RX"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:0
msgid "按 RX 容量预留记录和载荷槽，槽大小按帧载荷上限计算"
msgstr ""
"Reserve a record and payload slot for each RX capacity. Payload slots use the configured frame payload "
"upper bound."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:40
msgid "每类运行时资源拥有独立固定池，小 payload 不能占用 peer 或控制记录的预留容量。释放的槽位可以复用，不回退 heap，也不在运行期扩容。"
msgstr ""
"Each category has its own fixed pool. A small payload cannot consume a peer or control-record "
"reservation. Freed slots are reusable with no heap fallback or runtime expansion."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:42
msgid "容量和失败"
msgstr "Capacity and Failure"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:44
msgid "窗口容量属于单个 peer，TX 和乱序容量属于整个实例。耗尽时返回有界失败或延后推进，不自动扩容。ACK 释放的可靠 TX 槽可供应用提交新的 DATA。"
msgstr ""
"Window capacity is per peer; TX and out-of-order capacity are global. Exhaustion yields a bounded "
"failure or deferred work, not an automatic resize. An ACK releases a reliable TX slot for a new DATA "
"submission."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:46
msgid ""
"scope 由远端节点、connection ID 和 epoch 标识。恢复时不能在旧 scope 内静默重置序列号。应关闭旧 scope、排空未认证链路旧流量并使用新 "
"epoch；认证模式则关闭可信会话并安装新的可信参数。参见[发送 API](../guides/send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"A scope is identified by remote node, connection ID, and epoch. Recovery must not silently restart "
"sequence numbers within an old scope. Close the old scope, drain old unauthenticated traffic, and use a "
"new epoch; authenticated recovery closes the trusted session and installs fresh trusted parameters. See "
"[Send API](../guides/send.md)."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:48
msgid "无 Heap 构建"
msgstr "No-Heap Builds"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:50
msgid ""
"生产构建使用 `-DXGL_ALLOW_FALLBACK_MALLOC=OFF` 禁止库从 libc 分配。使用静态初始化，或通过显式分配器申请一次工作区。启用回退的构建在 "
"`xgl_init_allocated()` 的 allocator 参数为 `NULL` 时使用 libc。"
msgstr ""
"Use `-DXGL_ALLOW_FALLBACK_MALLOC=OFF` to prevent the production library from allocating through libc. "
"Use static initialization or allocate the workspace once through an explicit allocator. A build with "
"fallback enabled uses libc when `xgl_init_allocated()` receives a `NULL` allocator."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:52
msgid "协议的无 heap 结论不涵盖应用驱动和认证 provider，应检查包含这些组件的最终固件链接结果。"
msgstr ""
"A protocol no-heap claim does not cover application drivers or authentication providers. Inspect the "
"final linked firmware, including those components."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:54
msgid "测量"
msgstr "Measurement"

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:56
msgid ""
"只有 `requirements.size` 表示总字节数。`runtime_blocks` 是所有类别槽数之和；`runtime_block_size` 是最大槽位步长，两者相乘不能描述实际分区布局。"
msgstr ""
"Only `requirements.size` is the total byte count. `runtime_blocks` counts slots across all categories; "
"`runtime_block_size` is the largest stride. Multiplying them does not describe the partitioned layout."

#: docs/zh/explanation/resource-model.md:58
msgid "ABI、profile、路由数、帧大小及全部容量都会影响 RAM。用产品工具链测量 workspace 并检查最终链接固件。核算 BSP、应用缓冲、ISR 嵌套和完整调用链所需的栈。"
msgstr ""
"ABI, profile, route count, frame size, and all capacities affect RAM. Use the product toolchain to "
"measure workspace size and inspect the linked firmware. Account for BSP memory, application buffers, ISR"
" nesting and total call-stack depth."
